{"uid":"a583c098d39ad4f","name":"OIDC provider unreachable: the refresh token is sent once and never again, the popup comes up, \"Sign in again\" needs no password","fullName":"application.Samples.Feature.signInAgain.SignInAgainPopupTest.providerUnreachable_theTokenIsSentOnceThenPopup","historyId":"8248927a22e6b900fdc30f754c449496","time":{"start":1793013070471,"stop":1793013091914,"duration":21443},"description":"The token endpoint of the OIDC provider is unreachable. The renewal sends the refresh token once: a lost answer does not say whether the provider took the token, and sending the same one again is what ends the whole session, so the token is burnt. The renewal goes on with the SSO cookie through the hidden iframe, whose exchange of a code is unreachable as well, so the popup \"Session has expired\" comes up once the access token is over. With the provider back, \"Sign in again\" returns to the application without a login page: the SSO session has been alive all along.","descriptionHtml":"The token endpoint of the OIDC provider is unreachable. The renewal sends the refresh token once: a lost answer does not say whether the provider took the token, and sending the same one again is what ends the whole session, so the token is burnt. The renewal goes on with the SSO cookie through the hidden iframe, whose exchange of a code is unreachable as well, so the popup \"Session has expired\" comes up once the access token is over. With the provider back, \"Sign in again\" returns to the application without a login page: the SSO session has been alive all along.\n<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Manual run:</strong> <code>  \uD83D\uDCCB Copy  application.Samples.Feature.signInAgain.SignInAgainPopupTest#providerUnreachable_theTokenIsSentOnceThenPopup </code> into <a href=\"https://github.com/CX-Box/cxbox-code-samples/actions/workflows/build_button_qa.yml\">GitHub Actions</a> → <strong>Run Workflow</strong> → <strong>include PATH</strong>","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":